      "title_zh": "OpenAI 向 Plus 与 Pro 用户推送 GPT-5.6 Sol 更新版并新增滑块功能",
      "title_orig": "Re Plus and Pro users can access the updated version of GPT‑5.6 Sol in ChatGPT along with the new slider starting today. This version of GPT-5.6 Sol ...",
